TEXT 48 360 Left 2 ;CD74HC4067 channel switch. Ron is about 70 ohm at 3.3V (datasheet typical near 125 ohm at 4.5V, scaled).\n;Select edge to settled COM is dominated by Ron*Cload, about 2 ns, plus the logic delay (~30 ns).\n;Firmware waits delayMicroseconds(10) = 10 us. Margin is about 200x.
